  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional"><xpath>/Defs/VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef[defName="VRE_ChargerClaws"]</xpath><nomatch><li Class="PatchOperationAdd"><xpath>/Defs</xpath><value><VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_EvolutionGene"><defName>VRE_ChargerClaws</defName><label>charger claws</label><unlockable>false</unlockable><description>Carriers of this gene develop large charger claws, granting them the ability to perform a charge towards a target, dealing significant damage to anything in their path and easily destroying defenses, with the ability to perform this action periodically and over a considerable distance.</description><selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight><iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_ChargerClaws</iconPath><statOffsets><WorkSpeedGlobal>-0.4</WorkSpeedGlobal></statOffsets><displayOrderInCategory>1009</displayOrderInCategory><exclusionTags><li>Hands</li></exclusionTags><abilities><li>VFEI2_BreacherCharge_Colonists</li></abilities><modExtensions><li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension"><backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_EvolutionBG</backgroundPathEndogenes><backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_EvolutionBG</backgroundPathXenogenes></li></modExtensions></VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef></value></li></nomatch></Operation>
